  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening process for Citizenship By Investment in the Eastern Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening risk management processes by which applications are reviewed and understanding 
of the wider global industry within Eastern Caribbean Citizenship by Investment programmes
in order to reduce security risk to the countries running the programmes, to maximise revenues
deriving from the programmes and protect against a sudden drop from UK and EU visa imposition
and, by doing so, to protect the UK against national security risk.</narrative>
  </description>
